### Social studies and civics, grades 6 to 8

No lean either way. Unit 6's Gupta India sits near world geography and ancient civilizations II's "Faiths and
empires of ancient India" (unit 2), unit 10's Yuan China near its early China units, and unit 12's community issue
near civics, government and civic life's "Civic action" (unit 10); the theater units teach the setting they use
themselves, on research and object cards (bar criterion 7), and unit 12 asks for no civic action outside the showing.
No unit uses number work beyond counting beats and minutes (lesson 13).

