docs/reviews/frame-theater-grades-k-to-12-2026-11-25.md:188:| Are griot (music 3 to 5), Cinderella (media arts 3 to 5, Melies) and Roadside Theater / broadside (media arts 3 to 5, Posada broadside) repeats of theater 3 to 5? | Griot: music 3 to 5 uses kora players from griot families for sound; theater uses the jeli as tellers and the Sosso-Bala; overlapping culture, different job, acceptable if each names the other. Cinderella: different tellings (Melies film vs Ye Xian / Zuni retellings), acceptable. "Roadside" and "broadside" are not the same work. |
